<title>NEW ZEALAND: Zuellig swings into loss for half year.</title>
<headline>Zuellig swings into loss for half year.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr result to Sept 30</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				0.95 vs 31.7 profit</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    1.0 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Turnover			     209.8 vs 248.1</p>
<p>    Pretax loss			    0.2 vs 0.3 profit</p>
<p>    Tax					0.8 vs 1.2</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries			nil vs 32.6 credit</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)   113.6 vs 103.3</p>
<p>Dividend carries 0.4925 imputation credits.</p>
<p>Pay date Feb 21</p>
<p>Reg date Feb 7</p>
<p>Note - Zuellig New Zealand is a pharmaceuticals and health products company.</p>
</text>
